cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference the Auracelle platform or its frameworks, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "Auracelle: Strategic Cognition & Governance Stress-Testing Suite"
abstract: >
  Auracelle is a multi-module governance stress-testing suite for defense, 
  intelligence, international organizations, standards bodies, and policy 
  research institutes. It comprises three simulation platforms — Charlie 
  (AI governance policy), Orion (cyber escalation and resilience), and 
  Lyra (assurance and standards verification) — each grounded in the 
  proprietary E-AGPO-HT and E-AGSO-HT multi-stratum governance 
  intelligence frameworks developed by Grace-Alice Evans.
